  "notes": "Drafted by tools/draft_ui_descriptors.py from the provider's effective create/alter forms; field ids, options and visibility are the provider's own. Review tab placement, finish typing any keyvalue field listed under gaps, split combined constraint grids, then set status complete after a verified round trip. Alter-mode column changes (add_columns, drop_columns, rename_columns) are produced from the Columns grid diff; they are not separate fields. Reviewed by tools/review_ui_descriptors.py: constraints grid split into Primary key / Unique / Foreign keys / Check; parent picker (database). Reviewed by tools/review_ui_descriptors.py: column grid record keys. Round-tripped against MariaDB 10.11 by tools/tests/test_ui_descriptor_roundtrip_mariadb.py (create, re-inspect pre-fill, alter where the engine supports it).",
